request.description:
**EP-SC-161** · `GET /channel/delivery-calendar`

| | |
|---|---|
| Guard | `channel` |
| Idempotency | n/a |
| X-Client | `channel-web` |
| Name | تقويم التوصيل الأسبوعي |

Derived from channel_zone.delivery_days. week= any date in the week (Asia/Damascus); week_start is Sunday. No new table.

**Example response `data`:**
