request.description:
**EP-SC-019** · `POST /channel/catalog/import`

| | |
|---|---|
| Guard | `channel` |
| Permission | `sc.catalog.import` |
| Idempotency | required |
| X-Client | `channel-web` |
| Name | استيراد الكتالوج |

Columns: sku,name_ar,name_en,barcode,brand_id,category_id,status,base_price,currency_id. Multipart only.

**Example response `data`:**
```json
{
    "preview": [
        {
            "sku": "OIL-SUN-1L",
            "name_ar": "زيت",
            "status": "draft"
        }
    ],
    "errors": [
        {
            "row": 4,
            "message": "sku exists"
        }
    ],
    "duplicates": [
        "OIL-SUN-1L"
    ]
}
```

